<title>BELGIUM: Hydro Magnesium raises pure price to 5.75 Dm/Kg.</title>
<headline>Hydro Magnesium raises pure price to 5.75 Dm/Kg.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brussels-based metals company Hydro Magnesium, a unit of Norsk Hydro, said in a statement on Thursday it was raising its European producer price for pure magnesium to 5.75 from 5.55 marks a kilogram.</p>
<p>Its price of alloy magnesium remains unchanged at 5.40 marks.</p>
<p>&quot;The change reflects continuing improvement in market demand for magnesium and stable output from producers,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
